            <characteristic name="Unique Action" typeId="ba93-e32d-f1ac-e188">▶ Select one other friendly **NOVITIATE** operative (excluding **SUPERIOR**) visible to and within 3&quot; of this operative that isn’t currently benefitting from the effects of this action. Until the end of that operative’s next activation, add 1 to its APL stat, add 1&quot; to its Move stat, and it can perform two Fight actions during its next activation. 
